# Maps historical author names onto their canonical identity.
#
# The first 36 commits were recorded under the GitHub handle rather than a
# real name, on the same address. Git tooling and GitHub's contributor graph
# read this file, so the whole history reads as one person without rewriting
# a single commit.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Old Name <old@email>

